Vendored Quest Helper source (fork/questhelper branch only)
-----------------------------------------------------------
On the `fork/questhelper` branch, the entire Quest Helper source tree is
vendored unmodified under `src/main/java/com/questhelper/` (and its resources),
so that quest steps in the route can be driven by Quest Helper's own precise,
per-quest guidance. This is a redistribution of Quest Helper under the BSD
2-Clause License, with all original copyright notices retained in every file:

    Quest Helper - https://github.com/Zoinkwiz/quest-helper
    Copyright (c) 2019-2024, Zoinkwiz and contributors
    Licensed under the BSD 2-Clause License (see LICENSE-questhelper)

This branch is a fork intended for personal / sideload use; it is NOT the
version submitted to the RuneLite Plugin Hub (the hub does not accept duplicate
plugins). The Plugin-Hub-legit companion lives on the `main` branch.

